From d2e5226edc90e4d91dd53cb2c15e916a995ed950 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:40:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add EGL_RISCOS_platform_wimp and EGL_RISCOS_wimp_window

Reserve enumerant block 0x35A0-0x35AF for RISCOS (riscos-mesa) and
register two extensions, #156 and #157:

- EGL_RISCOS_platform_wimp: EGL_PLATFORM_RISCOS for
  EGL_EXT_platform_base (client extension).
- EGL_RISCOS_wimp_window: RISC OS native types (Wimp window handles,
  sprites, the whole screen), work area surfaces, screen banks, and
  eglRedrawWindowRISCOS / eglPlotSurfaceRISCOS for redrawing windows
  from the task's own Wimp_Poll loop.

Also adds a __riscos__ branch to eglplatform.h and regenerates the
headers.
